      ev: 'Carta aos acionistas de 1992 (texto integral): "An investor needs to do very few things right as long as he or she avoids big mistakes." A forma popular ("You only have to do a very few things right in your life so long as you don\'t do too many things wrong") não aparece em nenhuma carta 1977–2020 e só circula em sites de frases e livros de compilação.',
