      ev: 'Transcrição do discurso de Munger na formatura da USC Gould School of Law, 13 maio 2007 (PDF da transcrição no repositório GitHub awesome-charlie-munger): "I constantly see people rise in life who are not the smartest, sometimes not even the most diligent, but they are learning machines, they go to bed every night a little wiser than when they got up".',
